{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6c3c094845db4e20",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# OddsWell production system\n\nOne visual index for the tools, processes, decisions, and capability gaps used to build **World of Play**.\n\n⭐ **PRIMARY**   ● **ACTIVE**   🧪 **PILOT**   ◇ **PENDING**   ⏸ **DEFERRED**",
      "x": -250,
      "y": -950,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c23cf54ad134449",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1650,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "5",
      "label": "Project Brain and Control"
    },
    {
      "id": "670aa9cf9e7444b7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧠 Obsidian\n\n⭐ **PRIMARY**\n\nLocal brain for decisions, plans, art bible, research, standards, registers, and maps.\n\nCodex updates it during active work.",
      "x": -1420,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b57d78b38aa4d3a",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Development/Project Tool Register.md",
      "x": -1600,
      "y": -130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1ab6a488db34863",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# GitHub\n\n● **ACTIVE / PRIVATE**\n\nSource control, issues, branches, reviews, CI, and release history.\n\n[Open repository](https://github.com/nackster/oddswell-world-of-play)",
      "x": -1420,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "13cd07c3eaa14f0f",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "3",
      "label": "Planning and Development Workflow"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f0b48976bdf4fe0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🤖 Codex\n\n● **ACTIVE collaborator**\n\nResearch, game and technical design support, implementation, testing, documentation, and maintenance of the project brain during our work.",
      "x": -850,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5a601a444f944bc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🐎 Ponytail\n\n● **ACTIVE - full mode**\n\nMinimal, reuse-first development workflow that avoids unnecessary code while preserving safety and quality.",
      "x": -670,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c54f69f11d7642c1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Ruflo\n\n⏸ **DEFERRED**\n\nRevisit after the Phase 0 simulator exists and multi-agent automation has a measurable use case.",
      "x": -660,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b595b82bc354c72",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -150,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "Game Systems and Implementation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ee66c4cb28741b6",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Development/Current Plan.md",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7010c08860c44b2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🏀 Phase 0 simulation\n\n▶ **NEXT BUILD FOCUS**\n\nDeterministic basketball simulation, auditable events, athlete and team statistics, seasons, injuries, fatigue, and prediction validation.",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -170,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "620ac650b3cb440e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎮 Game engine\n\n◇ **PENDING DECISION**\n\nRequired for the Phase 1 one-city 3D vertical slice. Evaluate world building, character workflow, networking, performance, and maintainability.",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e70501724394aca",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 600,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "2",
      "label": "Art and 3D Content"
    },
    {
      "id": "72b40b83f1aa41be",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Art/Visual Consistency.md",
      "x": 650,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "9561e35113364ea7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎨 Higgsfield\n\n● **ACTIVE SUBSCRIPTION**\n\nConsistent references, turnarounds, item concepts, storyboards, and cinematic exploration. Notify the owner before paid generations.",
      "x": 840,
      "y": -170,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ad53d877fa84d33",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Visual Maps/3D Asset Toolchain.canvas",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca5ef5ea22fd4474",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "Economy, Release, and Risk Gates"
    },
    {
      "id": "f49d5ce040834180",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🪙 Unified credits\n\n◆ **DESIGN DIRECTION**\n\nPlayers earn, wager, save, spend, or purchase credits. The ledger and settlement system must be auditable and server-authoritative.",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "4477017ecf3a42c1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⚖️ Mandatory compliance gate\n\n⛔ **BEFORE CREDIT SALES OR MONETIZED WAGERING**\n\nLegal, platform, payment-provider, gambling, age-rating, consumer-protection, privacy, regional, fraud, chargeback, and refund review.",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8f5b2307123449e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🚀 Initial release target\n\n◇ **PC / Steam**\n\nRelease tooling, analytics, crash reporting, moderation, security, support, and live-operations choices remain pending.",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "e95a02b13a8440e2",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 2150,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "1",
      "label": "Always-On Production Gates"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfcc27c1df6e4913",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎯 1. Approve intent\n\nScope, style, player purpose, owner, and acceptance criteria are clear before production begins.",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "84e94661bde84a5d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🔎 2. Record provenance\n\nSource, prompt, model/version, settings, generation date, commercial license, and approved reference family.",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3dbc5674a9fa4f84",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧪 3. Production QA\n\nStyle, functionality, naming, topology, materials, animation, accessibility, security, and test coverage as applicable.",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "df4c382775d04205",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ✅ 4. Validate in context\n\nPerformance, gameplay, balance, lighting, devices, network behavior, player safety, and compliance before release.",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c93c56cdf4a54e32",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧩 Capability gaps to plan\n\nSimulation and backend engineering, UI/UX, technical art, rigging and animation, environment art, QA and balancing, security, live operations, and external legal/compliance review.",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
