    {
      "id": "f4ddc55cba3a4d79",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1650,
      "y": 1400,
      "width": 3750,
      "height": 1000,
      "color": "3",
      "label": "Efficiency Shortlist and Adoption Triggers"
    },
    {
      "id": "355f224ae68b4de1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🔐 Git + Git LFS 3.7.1 + GitHub\n\n● **ACTIVE FOUNDATION**\n\nPrivate repository and binary tracking are configured. Use Issues/Projects now. Add Actions after tests exist; keep any self-hosted runners private.",
      "x": -1370,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "75a194ce24f24a0c",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "90 Assets/Tool Logos/github-mark.svg",
      "x": -1580,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "93ec5f210d004f62",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "90 Assets/Tool Logos/git-lfs-icon.png",
      "x": -1540,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 100,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "7f98dac7a33c4fc6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🛠️ Blender 4.5.5 LTS + Geometry Nodes\n\n● **INSTALLED / PRIMARY**\n\nPinned production version. Use Geometry Nodes for repeated city assets and procedural placement before adding Houdini.",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3087695ff864744",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "90 Assets/Tool Logos/blender-logo.png",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 190,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "3d764075f9b840f5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎮 Engine benchmark\n\n🧪 **BEFORE PHASE 1**\n\nUnreal Engine 5.8 is the front-runner. Benchmark one real street block, a court, rigged player, NPCs, lighting, collision, navigation, server stub, and packaged PC performance.",
      "x": -150,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "24468afea445456e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🌐 Nakama\n\n🧪 **AFTER PHASE 0**\n\nSelf-hosted accounts, profiles, storage, matchmaking, leaderboards, tournaments, chat, and server runtime. Purchased-credit accounting still needs a dedicated auditable ledger.",
      "x": 710,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "75a5f36f2c5e412f",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "90 Assets/Tool Logos/nakama-logo.png",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "8ae66d5ec9d34ef0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎨 Art efficiency pilots\n\n🧪 **FIRST PRODUCTION ASSETS**\n\n**Substance Painter:** hero character + city prop texturing.\n\n**Rokoko Vision:** short basketball-motion capture and cleanup benchmark.",
      "x": 1510,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "73cebe78d5504dfa",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "90 Assets/Tool Logos/substance-painter-icon.svg",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 120,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "5ad47c38cfb241fc",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "90 Assets/Tool Logos/rokoko-logo.png",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 120,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "9fbc88c83a1845e8",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Development/Tool Efficiency Review.md",
      "x": -1550,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d72b006bd394ebd",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🚦 Tool intake gate\n\nAdopt only after one representative pilot records the bottleneck, baseline, setup and recurring costs, privacy and licensing, file ownership, migration path, production time, cleanup time, output quality, and revision difficulty.",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "40bb32582f754b29",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⏸ Keep deferred until triggered\n\nHoudini · Perforce · FMOD/Wwise · Sentry/analytics · PlayFab · additional mocap services · Ruflo\n\nA new tool must replace work—not merely add another place to manage it.",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "927809cb39674f91",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ✅ Adoption result\n\n**ADOPT:** measurable time saved without unacceptable quality or risk.\n\n**DEFER:** useful, but the trigger has not arrived.\n\n**REJECT:** duplicates the stack or fails the pilot.",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
